    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Hailing from Chitral in Northern Pakistan, Noor Shamsuddin is a graduate of AKU-IED's Master of Education (MEd) programme. He graduated in 2016 with a specialisation in Teacher Education (social studies). In September 2021, Noor prepares to embarks on yet another exciting academic journey as he begins his doctoral studies at  Nazarbayev University Graduate School of Education, Kazakhstan , on full scholarship.",
